<title>USA: Santa Fe Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr (loss)	$     (0.51)	   $	 0.05</p>
<p> Net (loss)		(10.1)		     8.4</p>
<p> Revs			172.7		    124.3</p>
<p> Oper income		  0.1			    0.9</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   90.9		     90.3</p>
<p>					 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $     (0.12)	   $	 0.13</p>
<p> Net			   36.4		     26.6</p>
<p> Revs			583.3		     449.4</p>
<p> Oper income		 89.5			    53.9</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   90.6			90.2</p>
<p>	     (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name of company is Santa Fe Energy Resources.</p>
<p>Revenues for fourth quarter 1995 and year 1995 have been restated to conform to 1996 presentation.</p>
<p>When adjusted for extraordinary and special items, income attributable to common shares increased to $54.2 million in 1996, or $0.60 per share, up from $8.6 million or $0.10 per share in 1995.</p>
<p>-- ((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
